### 登録 → 201 Digest / 400 (空・重複 URL) / 401 (Bearer なし)。status は draft (既定) か published。token は auth.http の createSession の応答から貼る
POST {{host}}/digests
Authorization: Bearer paste-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entryDate": "2026-10-17",
  "status": "published",
  "articles": [
    {
      "category": "IT系", "title": "Hello", "url": "https://example.com/hello",
      "children": [{ "title": "Hello (関連)", "url": "https://example.com/hello/related" }]
    },
    { "category": "その他", "title": "World", "url": "https://example.com/world" }
  ]
}

### latest → 200 Digest（公開の最新）/ 404 Problem type=/problems/not-found（公開が 1 件もない）
GET {{host}}/digests/latest

### 日付一覧 → 200 {digests: [{id, entryDate, status}]}（新しい順、0 件なら空配列）/ 401
GET {{host}}/digests
Authorization: Bearer paste-token-here

### 1 件 → 200 Digest / 404（その日付がない）/ 400（日付の形でない）/ 401
GET {{host}}/digests/2026-10-17
Authorization: Bearer paste-token-here

### 更新（全置換）→ 200 Digest / 400 (日付・URL の衝突) / 401 / 404。日付を変えるときは body の entryDate を新しい日付にする。status (published / private) を省くと今のまま
PUT {{host}}/digests/2026-10-17
Authorization: Bearer paste-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entryDate": "2026-10-18",
  "articles": [
    { "category": "IT系", "title": "Hello (直した)", "url": "https://example.com/hello" }
  ]
}

### 下書きへ戻す → 400 Problem type=/problems/validation-failed（更新の status は draft を受けない）
PUT {{host}}/digests/2026-10-18
Authorization: Bearer paste-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entryDate": "2026-10-18",
  "status": "draft",
  "articles": [
    { "category": "IT系", "title": "Hello", "url": "https://example.com/hello" }
  ]
}
